 "about": "Curious Woods names for the Allen brain (Michael's rulings, 15 Nov 2026). The model is never renamed. Each part keeps the atlas's own name (parts, below); CW's names sit on top (names). One CW name may point to several parts and one part may serve several names. Part keys are the names in HuBMAP's file without Allen_ and the side letter, after allen-true-names.json has put the eight swapped names right. A mesh is Allen_<key>_L or Allen_<key>_R.",
 "space": "Positions below are in the bench's model space: the model centred on its bounding box, scaled so its longest side is 1.72, x flipped so +x is the brain's left, +y up, +z front. One unit is 97.1 mm.",
